    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready for a race against the clock where you\u2019ll control a team of bulbs with unique abilities! In each level, you\u2019ll help these fragile bulbs overcome obstacles, rescue their companions, and finally light up in their sockets before time runs out.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Teamwork:</strong> Control up to 12 bulbs at once; each one can break with a single hit or fall into pits, so cooperation and planning are key.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Countdown:</strong> A battery indicates how much time is left. If it runs out, the bulbs \u201cfall asleep,\u201d and you\u2019ll have to start again!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collectibles:</strong> Gather lightning bolts in each level to unlock up to 3 lit-bulb trophies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Special Powers:</strong> Besides the regular blue bulb, you\u2019ll also have others with unique abilities (red to power up objects, purple to turn them off, and yellow for super speed) that activate when stepping on chips scattered throughout the stages.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore a wide variety of handcrafted levels</strong> with multi-floor puzzles that challenge you to think across different layers of each stage.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>High Replayability:</strong> The bulbs\u2019 fragility and the constant time pressure make each attempt different, encouraging you to refine your strategies.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to embark on this puzzle-platform adventure where <strong>every second counts</strong>?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready for a race against the clock where you\u2019ll control a team of bulbs with unique abilities! In each level, you\u2019ll help these fragile bulbs overcome obstacles, rescue their companions, and finally light up in their sockets before time runs out.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Teamwork:</strong> Control up to 12 bulbs at once; each one can break with a single hit or fall into pits, so cooperation and planning are key.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Countdown:</strong> A battery indicates how much time is left. If it runs out, the bulbs \u201cfall asleep,\u201d and you\u2019ll have to start again!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collectibles:</strong> Gather lightning bolts in each level to unlock up to 3 lit-bulb trophies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Special Powers:</strong> Besides the regular blue bulb, you\u2019ll also have others with unique abilities (red to power up objects, purple to turn them off, and yellow for super speed) that activate when stepping on chips scattered throughout the stages.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore a wide variety of handcrafted levels</strong> with multi-floor puzzles that challenge you to think across different layers of each stage.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>High Replayability:</strong> The bulbs\u2019 fragility and the constant time pressure make each attempt different, encouraging you to refine your strategies.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to embark on this puzzle-platform adventure where <strong>every second counts</strong>?</p>",
